[Cheats/Enable Debug Mode Controller 1 Triangle + Circle + X + Square + Start will return you to the title screen.Select + Triangle will enable or disable progressive mode.Controller 2 Circle to toggle debug modes. Press this once or twice to enable sound test options in the Sound Settings menu in the Options menu. This will also open a scene select menu in the pause menu in-game.Square to toggle Debug flag on or off. This will temporarily unlock everything when on]
